    <!-- SECTION 1: PHILOSOPHY -->
    <section class="wrap story-grid alternate">
      <div class="story-content reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our Philosophy</span>
        <h2>Why MITRA Exists</h2>
        <p>A home is not just a selection of rooms or a collection of cabinet parameters; it is a physical container for your daily life. We believe the spaces we occupy shape who we are—affecting our moods, our routines, and the memories we build.</p>
        <p>MITRA was founded to challenge the compromise between high-end architectural design and transparent, honest implementation. We exist to bring emotional resonance, absolute pricing transparency, and uncompromising structural integrity to every home we design and construct.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="story-img reveal delay-1">
