    <!-- SECTION 2: CRAFTSMANSHIP & DETAILS -->
    <section class="wrap story-grid">
      <div class="story-img reveal">
        {% image "images/external/ext_45525aa8.jpg", "Architectural material finishes and craftsmanship joinery", "100vw", "", "auto" %}
      </div>
      <div class="story-content reveal delay-1">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Details</span>
        <h2>What Craftsmanship Means</h2>
        <p>To us, craftsmanship is the invisible alignment of a joint, the tactile warmth of premium veneer, and the silent, soft-close glide of a drawer channel. It is detail made visible. We believe that true luxury does not shout; it performs reliably day after day, year after year.</p>
        <p>By operating our own modular manufacturing facility, sourcing certified BWP plywood directly, and adhering to strict engineering tolerances, we guarantee that the final physical handover matches the beauty of the initial 3D design board.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

